{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_023240","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Gálvez教授竟然是KGB……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":34,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"我还以为他是真心担心哥斯达黎加的未来，才来帮助我的……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"你不知道吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"真的！相信我，Snake。他说自己在大学研究和平，有自己的研究室，身份证明也都是真的……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":122,"review_flag":"AUX_OMISSION_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"他们会编造滴水不漏的掩护身份潜伏下来。身份、工作，有时甚至连家人都会准备好。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":114,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"你会上当也不奇怪。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"Snake，你早就知道吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":29,"review_flag":"AUX_MISALIGNED_JPN_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"嗯。从第一次见到他的时候就……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":"AUX_MISALIGNED_JPN_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"真希望你能告诉我……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":"AUX_MISALIGNED_JPN_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"抱歉。我不知道该不该告诉你，也不想把你卷进多余的麻烦里。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_JPN_TRANSLATED"},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"可你居然看出来了？明明只见了一眼。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":"AUX_MISALIGNED_JPN_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"是气味。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"气味？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"那是一种被赋予任务、并对任务忠诚到底的人才有的气味……说白了，我只是闻出了同类的气味。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":129,"review_flag":"JPN_SAME_KIND_CLAUSE_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"Snake，好厉害。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":20,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text